-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west"],"depart":6600,"plain":"HORSE, SCOUT NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":"DKQRA, RNKUT JKQTD OMJG WART."},{"seq":1028,"t":6300,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1707,"retries":0},{"seq":1029,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Tiger has offered a truce, which aligns with my doctrine to offer a truce early. Since I am Kite, I should accept it to isolate Rhino and Orchid. My troops are relatively centralized. I will hold F2 (Middle Ford) and use my archers/cav to screen/attack if Tiger moves aggressively"},{"seq":1030,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c377","house":"kite","letter":"L446","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":6600,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"BEQRS BKKS, DKHO TS IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":1031,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c378","house":"kite","letter":"L447","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":6600,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RNLKJO BKKS, DKHO TS IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":1032,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c379","house":"kite","letter":"L448","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","north-village","n-mid"],"depart":6600,"plain":"BOWMEN, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"AKWINJ, DKHO TS IEOOHN BKQO."},{"seq":1033,"t":6300,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1806,"retries":0},{"seq":1034,"t":6300,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Watch 22. Tiger truce is active. Orchid must consolidate position and probe weaknesses. Rhino/Tiger presence at F1/SW suggests immediate pressure. I will reinforce F1 and probe enemy dispositions via scouting/positioning, adhering to doctrine."},{"seq":1035,"t":6300,"type":"courier","id":"c380","house":"orchid","letter":"L449","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west"],"depart":6300,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1036